WEBVTT

00:01.270 --> 00:03.190
<b></b>Somewhere in Tokyo, 20XX

02:10.900 --> 02:14.620
M-Many people escaped during the attack 
on the Ariake Natural Protection Zone—

02:14.620 --> 02:16.240
That isn't the issue.

02:16.780 --> 02:19.240
The problem is that Blue got away.

02:20.000 --> 02:22.050
You can't underestimate 
a magical girl's power.

02:22.050 --> 02:23.000
Oh, dear.

02:23.000 --> 02:26.740
Why can't you just find a way to enjoy this?

02:26.740 --> 02:28.380
Slayer!

02:28.380 --> 02:31.180
Don't tell me you forgot 
what happened that time.

02:32.740 --> 02:34.130
The Nakano Incident.

02:34.130 --> 02:35.630
2009

02:34.130 --> 02:35.630
<b>Nakano</b>

02:34.530 --> 02:39.300
In 2009, rioting otaku attacked 
the Nakano depository.

02:35.630 --> 02:36.630
<b>Goods</b>

02:39.300 --> 02:42.360
They stole a large number of artifacts.

02:42.620 --> 02:44.280
That's when we first became aware

02:44.280 --> 02:47.890
of the existence 
of the insurrectionist forces

02:47.890 --> 02:51.400
<b>Nakano</b>

02:47.890 --> 02:51.400
and the great powers 
of the magical girls supporting them.

02:51.400 --> 02:57.900
Akiba

02:52.390 --> 02:55.210
The scoundrels then occupied Akihabara.

02:55.210 --> 02:57.910
The situation has remained 
in a deadlock ever since.

02:57.910 --> 03:01.410
If those three manage 
to combine forces again...

03:04.750 --> 03:12.470
One, two, three, four...

03:12.470 --> 03:16.460
...four. One, two, three, four.

03:20.620 --> 03:21.480
Huh?

03:22.760 --> 03:24.230
Huh?

03:28.490 --> 03:30.420
Huh? What the—?!

03:31.010 --> 03:32.480
Pee-yew!

03:32.480 --> 03:33.270
Blue!

03:33.270 --> 03:34.560
The hell are you doing?

03:37.120 --> 03:40.120
What's that stank coming from?

03:40.120 --> 03:43.600
It's surrr... strömming.

03:45.240 --> 03:48.400
Take it outside!

03:52.750 --> 03:53.980
Hold your breath.

03:53.980 --> 03:55.750
Damn, that stinks!

03:56.130 --> 03:59.500
Oh, come on! What're you gonna do to me?

03:59.500 --> 04:01.780
Think on what you did, asshole!

04:01.780 --> 04:03.560
I'm busy over here.

04:03.560 --> 04:06.880
Okay, what's left? 
40 dozen rolls toilet paper,

04:06.880 --> 04:09.520
as much veggies and yakisoba as we can get,

04:09.520 --> 04:10.650
and gas masks.

04:10.650 --> 04:12.080
Gas masks?

04:12.080 --> 04:15.650
Because the hideout reeks now! 
It's your own damn fault!

04:16.150 --> 04:17.890
Gas masks...

04:27.800 --> 04:28.770
Whatcha lookin' at?

04:28.770 --> 04:30.530
Huh? Oh.

04:30.530 --> 04:32.240
Gas masks?

04:32.240 --> 04:34.780
Might be a clue about Pink-chan.

04:34.780 --> 04:35.860
Pink?

04:35.860 --> 04:38.540
Yeah. Will he answer?

04:38.910 --> 04:40.060
Oh, Nick!

04:40.060 --> 04:42.820
<i>Yo, Otaku Hero. How's things?</i>

04:42.820 --> 04:44.040
Not bad.

04:44.040 --> 04:46.800
Feels like I bit off 
more than I can chew, though.

04:48.720 --> 04:51.420
<i>I hear you raised hell at one of the camps.</i>

04:51.420 --> 04:52.310
<i>Nice work, man.</i>

04:53.720 --> 04:55.600
He sure is informed.

04:55.600 --> 04:59.320
Yeah, he's a mod of Ura-Nico 
and a super hacker.

04:59.320 --> 05:02.730
He's the reason we could use 
the field at Akiba.

05:02.730 --> 05:03.930
That was him?

05:03.930 --> 05:06.320
<i>I've heard all about you, Magical Girl.</i>

05:06.320 --> 05:08.670
Oh, hey. I'm Anarchy.

05:08.670 --> 05:09.860
<i>How's it going?</i>

05:09.860 --> 05:11.200
Blue-chan's here too.

05:11.200 --> 05:13.910
Here ya go! Here ya go! 
Here ya go! Here ya go!

05:13.150 --> 05:13.910
My pleasure!

05:13.920 --> 05:14.380
My pleasure!

05:14.390 --> 05:14.790
My pleasure!

05:14.790 --> 05:15.330
My pleasure!

05:16.970 --> 05:18.360
<i>Looks like she's doing good.</i>

05:18.360 --> 05:20.890
So, Nick, wanna do me a favor?

05:20.890 --> 05:21.600
<i>Huh?</i>

05:23.740 --> 05:25.760
<i>A rave?</i>

05:25.780 --> 05:26.420
Yeah.

05:26.680 --> 05:29.800
Can you find out where 
it's being streamed from?

05:29.800 --> 05:30.920
<i>Hold on.</i>

05:34.070 --> 05:35.620
Kyo-chan died?

05:36.220 --> 05:37.180
Oh?

05:37.310 --> 05:38.690
<b>Otaku</b>

05:37.760 --> 05:38.680
From Nick.

05:38.680 --> 05:41.000
How did he know my address?

05:41.000 --> 05:42.370
'Cause he's Nick.

05:42.370 --> 05:43.450
Creepy!

05:43.450 --> 05:45.840
Hey, this looks like a map.

05:44.320 --> 05:46.110
<b>Here</b>

05:45.840 --> 05:47.250
That's here!

05:46.110 --> 05:48.820
<b>Here</b>

05:46.110 --> 05:48.820
Akiba

05:46.110 --> 05:48.820
<b>Hideout</b>

05:47.250 --> 05:48.840
It's right behind us!

05:51.820 --> 05:52.920
Here?

05:52.920 --> 05:54.230
I think so.

05:54.570 --> 05:57.340
I had no idea a place like this was here.

05:57.340 --> 05:59.280
Right under our noses.

05:59.280 --> 06:00.960
We just didn't see it.

06:00.960 --> 06:01.960
<b>Pink's Hideout</b>

06:01.710 --> 06:03.440
Look what it says!

06:01.960 --> 06:04.460
<b>Pink's Hideout</b>

06:04.640 --> 06:07.080
Hey, I'm startin' to get tired.

06:07.080 --> 06:10.480
Say what? We haven't 
even walked three minutes!

06:08.970 --> 06:10.470
Here

06:10.480 --> 06:13.190
I'm sore from being strung up so long.

06:13.190 --> 06:15.690
You were slapping 
volleyballs around like crazy!

06:15.690 --> 06:16.730
Whatevs.

06:17.730 --> 06:21.470
Well, everyone seems happy 
you came back, though.

06:21.740 --> 06:23.220
I guess I'll go.

06:23.220 --> 06:25.450
B-Blue-chan, where to?

06:25.450 --> 06:26.330
Who's that from?

06:26.330 --> 06:29.960
A guy I met on a hookup site 
said he'd take me out for Chinese.

06:29.960 --> 06:31.650
You shouldn't go, Blue-chan!

06:31.650 --> 06:33.870
You don't know what he'll do to you!

06:33.870 --> 06:35.550
Well, yeah, but gee,

06:35.550 --> 06:39.450
while I was locked up, my <i>basic 
physical needs</i> were all ignored.

06:40.710 --> 06:41.290
<b>Food</b>

06:41.040 --> 06:41.880
<b>Sleep</b>

06:41.540 --> 06:43.460
<b>Sex</b>

06:43.470 --> 06:45.960
You gotta keep a girl satisfied.

06:45.970 --> 06:46.930
I'll treat you!

06:46.930 --> 06:48.110
Lemme take you!

06:48.110 --> 06:50.110
No! I'll satisfy you!

06:50.110 --> 06:52.800
Oh, okonomiyaki sounds good, too.

06:55.400 --> 06:58.370
Sometimes I'm not sure 
if we should've saved you.

06:58.370 --> 06:59.480
Oh!

07:02.100 --> 07:03.990
Found something nice!

07:03.990 --> 07:04.610
Oh, no!

07:05.780 --> 07:08.520
God, this feels so good.

07:08.520 --> 07:11.170
Yeah, I'm definitely not sure.

07:30.420 --> 07:31.630
Go.

07:33.400 --> 07:35.620
To think you were here right next to us.

07:35.620 --> 07:38.310
It's been a while, Pink-chan.

07:41.080 --> 07:44.600
Hey! Wai—! Hold on!

07:44.600 --> 07:46.730
Ow, ow, ow!

07:47.110 --> 07:50.580
Looks like we might not be welcome.

07:53.480 --> 07:55.000
Gobo-bo.

07:56.450 --> 07:58.600
Hasn't changed a bit.

07:58.600 --> 08:00.340
Blue, will you translate?

08:00.340 --> 08:01.480
For sure.

08:01.480 --> 08:03.710
Gobo gobo...

08:01.480 --> 08:04.360
"What could you possibly want with me?"

08:03.710 --> 08:06.370
Gobo gobo, gobo gobo...

08:04.360 --> 08:06.370
"I have no intention of leaving."

08:06.370 --> 08:08.800
"I'm staying here with my children forever."

08:08.800 --> 08:12.000
You can't keep dancing in the dark 
for the rest of your life!

08:12.000 --> 08:15.130
But if you want to try, 
help us defeat Shobon!

08:15.130 --> 08:18.770
We have the power to do it. 
We're magical girls!

08:18.770 --> 08:22.020
Gobo gobo...

08:19.110 --> 08:22.020
"You haven't changed one bit,
Akabane Kirara."

08:22.010 --> 08:23.390
Hey, no using my real name!

08:23.390 --> 08:26.570
Gobo, gobo...

08:23.600 --> 08:26.580
"You just want the power to fight."

08:27.520 --> 08:35.430
Gobo gobo...

08:28.210 --> 08:30.640
"You're a magical girl. So what?"

08:30.640 --> 08:33.660
"You're just a tool 
for other people's battles."

08:33.660 --> 08:35.430
"That's not for me!"

08:35.750 --> 08:39.400
"Greedy otaku staring, putting me 
in situations I don't want..."

08:40.180 --> 08:43.520
So you stay here in your nice little 
fan club instead, all warm and cozy,

08:43.520 --> 08:46.930
where everyone spoils you like a princess?

08:46.930 --> 08:52.820
Gobo gobo...

08:47.360 --> 08:51.440
"When I'm with my children, 
I can live the way I was meant to."

08:51.440 --> 08:52.820
"And..."

08:54.550 --> 08:59.580
"And if I don't take my 
shots every day, I'll die."

08:59.580 --> 09:01.440
"But you still want me to fight?"

09:01.440 --> 09:02.920
You damn liar!

09:02.920 --> 09:05.850
I know you spike those shots 
with a little something special.

09:05.850 --> 09:06.930
Huh...

09:06.930 --> 09:08.060
Gobo?

09:08.060 --> 09:09.090
Stop it!

09:09.090 --> 09:10.060
Yeah!

09:10.060 --> 09:11.480
Quit bullying Pink-chan!

09:11.480 --> 09:14.100
Pink-chan doesn't want to fight anymore!

09:14.100 --> 09:15.010
That's right!

09:15.010 --> 09:17.680
This is Pink-chan's and our utopia!

09:17.680 --> 09:19.110
Yeah, it's our paradise!

09:19.110 --> 09:22.710
We want to live here happily 
with Pink-chan forever!

09:22.710 --> 09:24.560
Don't take Pink-chan from us!

09:25.570 --> 09:26.660
Pink-chan.

09:27.960 --> 09:30.960
I think I know how you feel.

09:30.960 --> 09:32.960
Gobo-bo-bo...

09:31.510 --> 09:32.960
"Otaku Hero..."

09:32.960 --> 09:36.780
You must be really tired of it all.

09:36.780 --> 09:40.800
Actually, a while ago I got 
a little burned out, too.

09:40.800 --> 09:41.720
Gobo?

09:41.720 --> 09:45.600
But Anarchy-chan helped me remember.

09:45.600 --> 09:49.860
We're making the world a place where 
you can like whatever you want to like again!

09:49.860 --> 09:53.560
That's why our <i>moe</i> will never burn out!

09:53.560 --> 09:55.560
Nice one!

09:55.560 --> 09:57.000
That's right, Pink!

09:57.000 --> 10:00.160
When we three magical girls 
are together, I know we'll win!

10:00.160 --> 10:01.830
Come on, Blue, say something.

10:01.830 --> 10:03.680
This place reeks of sweat.

10:03.680 --> 10:04.790
Sniff, sniff.

10:05.720 --> 10:07.290
Gobo.

10:06.170 --> 10:07.290
"Fine."

10:10.040 --> 10:11.230
Pink-chan?

10:12.290 --> 10:17.260
Gobo gobo...

10:12.790 --> 10:17.260
"If you want to take me out of here, 
show me you're serious."

10:18.300 --> 10:19.230
Serious?

10:19.230 --> 10:22.840
Gobo gobo-bo...

10:19.720 --> 10:22.840
"Akabane Kirara, Kanda Blueberry Ai."

10:22.840 --> 10:24.170
<i>That's</i> your real name?!

10:24.750 --> 10:28.060
This drug will test your resolve.

10:28.060 --> 10:31.690
Huh... If we take it, then what?

10:31.690 --> 10:38.410
Go-bo, gobo...

10:31.940 --> 10:34.670
"I guess you'll have to wait and see."

10:34.670 --> 10:38.410
"If you don't take it, 
you can turn right around and leave."

10:38.410 --> 10:41.070
That's so rock 'n' roll.

10:41.070 --> 10:42.070
Fine.

10:43.490 --> 10:46.080
Anarchy-chan. Blue-chan.

10:53.460 --> 10:56.700
I-Is this poison?

10:55.660 --> 10:57.980
This is the shit!

10:57.960 --> 11:02.720
Gobo-bo...

10:58.370 --> 11:01.410
"Now I know you're serious."

11:02.720 --> 11:04.520
Wh-What'd she say?

11:04.520 --> 11:06.390
We're gonna fight.

11:06.390 --> 11:09.680
Damn it! That little punk.

11:10.730 --> 11:12.620
H-Huh?! What the—?

11:12.620 --> 11:14.720
She dead? Up and died?

11:14.720 --> 11:16.210
They're connected.

11:16.210 --> 11:17.100
Huh?

11:17.100 --> 11:18.960
Everyone who takes the drug,

11:18.960 --> 11:21.680
their consciousness becomes 
one until it wears off.

11:21.680 --> 11:23.000
You didn't know?

11:23.000 --> 11:26.050
Anything imaginable can 
happen inside Pink-chan's head.

11:26.050 --> 11:27.990
Her mind is infinite!

11:31.330 --> 11:34.840
What the hell is this?

11:40.550 --> 11:42.280
This feels so good.

11:42.280 --> 11:45.020
Huh? This isn't water?

11:46.620 --> 11:47.400
What.

12:04.800 --> 12:08.710
Damn it! This is what 
Pink's head is full of?

12:08.710 --> 12:10.460
It's wild, huh? So wild.

12:10.460 --> 12:11.980
I actually don't hate it.

12:11.980 --> 12:13.550
This isn't the time!

12:13.850 --> 12:16.460
Anyway, we gotta go find Pink.

12:18.040 --> 12:22.490
Oh? This part isn't so... bad? Uh...

12:27.120 --> 12:29.640
This is why I hate brain stuff!

12:29.640 --> 12:30.920
If that's how it is...

12:30.920 --> 12:32.050
Transform!

12:54.750 --> 12:57.070
Here to destroy both chaos and order,

12:57.070 --> 12:59.920
Magical Girl Anarchy!

13:00.710 --> 13:02.840
Heaven's Claptrap!

13:05.920 --> 13:06.840
See dat?

13:06.840 --> 13:09.000
If anything goes here, we can't lose.

13:10.080 --> 13:11.170
What now?

13:15.980 --> 13:18.720
Still don't hate it!

13:21.360 --> 13:24.560
Hmm. Just barely... out.

13:24.560 --> 13:26.560
Th-They gonna be okay?

13:27.610 --> 13:29.440
Looks like they can't lift a finger.

13:29.440 --> 13:30.620
How can you tell?

13:40.600 --> 13:41.630
What's that?

13:44.730 --> 13:46.010
Body pillows?

14:17.720 --> 14:19.520
Damn it!

14:19.520 --> 14:22.920
Yeah, right there, right there! 
This feels so good!

14:22.920 --> 14:27.170
You psycho bitch! 
I never should've saved you!

14:27.170 --> 14:29.010
Oh, don't say that.

14:29.010 --> 14:32.390
But since you did, I owe you one.

14:32.390 --> 14:35.430
Otaku Hero-sama's dream is my dream!

14:35.650 --> 14:36.660
Blue...

14:36.660 --> 14:37.930
Get a load of this.

14:38.430 --> 14:39.690
Transform!

14:59.710 --> 15:03.340
Fly on into my world!

15:03.950 --> 15:05.330
Magical Girl

15:06.990 --> 15:08.060
Blue!

15:11.300 --> 15:13.440
Territorio Assoluto!

15:19.430 --> 15:22.440
Hey, you aren't half bad!

15:22.940 --> 15:25.950
Whoa, is this place what it looks like?

15:25.950 --> 15:27.680
Probably.

15:44.700 --> 15:46.440
Come out, Pink!

15:46.440 --> 15:47.970
Come on out!

15:57.130 --> 15:58.130
Pink!

15:58.130 --> 16:00.400
Go-bo go-bo?

15:58.140 --> 16:00.400
"Are you enjoying yourselves?"

16:00.400 --> 16:02.100
Don't flatter yourself.

16:02.100 --> 16:04.150
Let's hurry and get this over with.

16:04.150 --> 16:06.160
Gobo, gobo gobo?

16:04.430 --> 16:06.160
"Should I go easy on you?"

16:06.160 --> 16:08.160
Don't insult me! Give it all you got!

16:10.150 --> 16:11.150
<b>Transform</b>

16:19.040 --> 16:19.410
<b>Self-Righteousness</b>

16:19.830 --> 16:20.200
<b>Hope</b>

16:21.080 --> 16:21.450
<b>Love</b>

16:22.160 --> 16:22.660
<b>Transience</b>

16:27.250 --> 16:28.170
<b>Transformation Complete</b>

16:28.170 --> 16:29.170
Gobo gobo.

16:28.670 --> 16:29.170
<b>Illusion</b>

16:29.170 --> 16:30.170
Gobo.

16:29.670 --> 16:30.170
<b>Judgment</b>

16:30.170 --> 16:31.180
Gobo!

16:30.670 --> 16:31.170
<b>Carnage</b>

16:31.170 --> 16:32.440
Gobo!

16:31.920 --> 16:33.170
<b>Awakening</b>

16:33.170 --> 16:34.800
Gobo gobo!

16:33.170 --> 16:35.680
<b>Magical Girl Pink</b>

16:35.990 --> 16:39.680
Go-bo gobo...

16:36.560 --> 16:39.680
"Now prove to me how serious you a—"

16:43.730 --> 16:45.320
It's begun.

16:46.740 --> 16:50.480
Good luck, Anarchy-chan, Blue-chan!

16:57.120 --> 16:58.910
Gobo-bo!

16:58.910 --> 17:01.540
Gobo!

17:04.760 --> 17:06.920
Not bad. Now it's my turn.

17:07.410 --> 17:09.380
Heaven's Sacrifice!

17:12.470 --> 17:13.630
Go-bo.

17:16.560 --> 17:17.010
What?

17:21.800 --> 17:29.020
Gobo gobo...

17:22.480 --> 17:29.020
"How did you think you could 
defeat me inside my own mind?"

17:30.000 --> 17:33.150
You can't have forgotten everything.

17:33.410 --> 17:34.790
Try to remember!

17:34.790 --> 17:38.530
Our first battle. The promise we made!

17:38.810 --> 17:41.240
We did it!

17:39.990 --> 17:41.240
All right!

17:43.770 --> 17:47.350
This isn't the end of our battle.

17:47.350 --> 17:48.790
It's just the beginning.

17:48.790 --> 17:51.160
You sound so cool, Spooky-cha—

17:51.160 --> 17:52.540
It's Anarchy!

17:57.140 --> 17:58.450
Let's swear to it!

17:59.300 --> 18:02.250
Magical girls never lose. Always win!

18:02.250 --> 18:05.050
We'll win and then turn back 
into normal girls!

18:05.600 --> 18:06.880
Gobo gobo.

18:06.880 --> 18:08.430
What do you mean "normal"?

18:08.430 --> 18:12.230
That's, well, um... I'm not sure.

18:12.230 --> 18:13.830
You aren't sure?

18:13.830 --> 18:15.700
But it's gotta be fun!

18:15.700 --> 18:19.200
A world where everyone can 
like whatever they want to like!

18:19.950 --> 18:21.500
What they want?

18:22.120 --> 18:25.210
In that case, I want to go 
to a New Order concert!

18:26.300 --> 18:27.860
If you say so.

18:28.100 --> 18:29.200
And you, Pink?

18:31.200 --> 18:33.710
Gobo gobo, gobo gobo.

18:35.200 --> 18:38.110
"I want to work at a maid cafe," she says.

18:41.170 --> 18:43.520
Cool. It's a promise.

18:47.900 --> 18:49.600
We will win!

18:49.600 --> 18:52.600
We'll win and become normal girls again.

18:52.600 --> 18:54.740
Gobo gobo, gobo gobo!

18:52.600 --> 18:54.740
"And like what we want to like!"

18:54.740 --> 18:57.720
A world that can say "like"!

18:57.720 --> 18:59.640
Let's bring it back!

19:02.450 --> 19:04.730
Pink, please remember.

19:13.570 --> 19:15.570
Everyone, let's go!

19:15.570 --> 19:16.500
Yeah.

19:19.640 --> 19:22.140
Go!

19:22.660 --> 19:24.850
If you can't remember,

19:24.850 --> 19:28.390
if you don't want to 
remember, that's too bad.

19:28.940 --> 19:30.050
Do it.

19:32.150 --> 19:33.650
Go!

19:34.640 --> 19:36.120
Pink-chan!

19:38.400 --> 19:39.650
The gas masks!

19:39.650 --> 19:40.840
Gobo-bo?

19:40.840 --> 19:42.960
Pink-chan, we know how you feel!

19:42.960 --> 19:44.890
We're the only ones who know!

19:44.890 --> 19:48.250
Pink-chan, we know that you still have hope!

19:48.250 --> 19:49.530
G-Gobo...

19:49.530 --> 19:52.000
Go back to being a magical girl!

19:52.000 --> 19:53.900
We'll all be okay!

19:53.900 --> 19:55.510
This isn't goodbye.

19:55.510 --> 19:57.540
This is your graduation, Pink-chan!

19:57.540 --> 20:00.460
As our princess, and as our idol!

20:00.460 --> 20:01.300
Gobo...

20:02.300 --> 20:04.640
We'll graduate, too!

20:04.960 --> 20:08.050
From this dream we shared with you!

20:08.050 --> 20:12.860
We want you to fulfill 
your true dreams, Pink-chan!

20:13.560 --> 20:15.510
We'll always be waiting for you.

20:15.880 --> 20:16.810
Gobo!

20:18.810 --> 20:21.030
Wh-What the heck?

20:22.480 --> 20:24.600
Had a feeling this would happen.

20:38.400 --> 20:39.080
Go—?

20:45.130 --> 20:46.800
Gobo gobo.

20:47.210 --> 20:49.350
"I'm back," she said.

20:49.350 --> 20:52.580
Damn it. We couldn't even beat her.

20:52.580 --> 20:54.240
We didn't need to.

20:54.240 --> 20:54.850
Huh?

20:54.850 --> 20:58.270
I don't really get what 
happened, but I'm glad.

20:58.270 --> 21:00.110
Welcome back, Pink-chan.

21:05.230 --> 21:06.600
And thanks, everyone!

21:06.600 --> 21:08.920
Without... your help...

21:08.920 --> 21:10.870
They okay like this?

21:14.680 --> 21:16.080
Right here, on this day,

21:15.920 --> 21:16.460
<b>O
T
OTAKU
K
U</b>

21:16.780 --> 21:19.460
three magical girls have rejoined forces!

21:19.910 --> 21:23.210
Anarchy! Blue! Pink!

21:23.530 --> 21:25.720
With the true power 
of the Revolutionary Army,

21:25.720 --> 21:27.260
our true determination,

21:27.260 --> 21:30.220
we're going to teach 
the Shobon Army a lesson!

21:30.220 --> 21:32.720
Our war is just beginning!

21:32.980 --> 21:35.980
Yeah!

21:35.980 --> 21:37.980
Now that's a red flag!

23:08.400 --> 23:09.940
Hi, everyone!

23:09.940 --> 23:13.930
Today is my debut concert! 
Thank you for coming!

23:13.930 --> 23:16.880
Yay!

23:16.540 --> 23:19.960
<b>My Memories
with Pink-Chan</b>

23:16.880 --> 23:19.960
Here we go! One, two, three, four!

23:19.960 --> 23:22.640
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!

23:22.640 --> 23:24.960
Ooh, yahoo!

23:25.560 --> 23:28.590
<i>A tranquil moment, a turbulent unrest.</i>

23:28.960 --> 23:31.040
<i>Dazzling memories.</i>

23:31.040 --> 23:33.720
<i>A towering hatred runs amok</i>

23:33.720 --> 23:36.720
<i>on roads leading hither 
and thither and nowhere at all.</i>

23:36.990 --> 23:39.970
<i>The avatar of destruction
descends from above.</i>

23:39.980 --> 23:46.980
<b>Destroy!!!</b>
